{
 "post_id": "var-livres-3",
 "slides": {
  "1": {
   "textes": {
    "T1": {
     "en": [
      "5 things i did that fixed my",
      "phone addiction"
     ],
     "texte": "5 livres qui se lisent comme une [[série]]"
    },
    "T2": {
     "en": [
      "(from 14 hours",
      "screen time to 3)"
     ],
     "texte": "(impossible de les lâcher, juré)"
    }
   },
   "images": {
    "I1": {
     "remplacer": {
      "source": "sources/os_197014e3.jpg",
      "boite": [
       0,
       0,
       2048,
       2048
      ]
     }
    }
   }
  },
  "2": {
   "textes": {
    "T1": {
     "en": [
      "make decisions before you feel ready"
     ],
     "texte": "1. [[Chronique d'une mort annoncée]]"
    },
    "T2": {
     "en": [
      "there will never be a",
      "perfect moment, you will",
      "never feel ready"
     ],
     "texte": "García Márquez. dès la page 1, tu sais qu'il va mourir"
    },
    "T3": {
     "en": [
      "take that risk you've",
      "been thinking about, you",
      "have nothing to lose"
     ],
     "texte": "tout le village le savait, personne l'a prévenu. [[tu dois savoir pourquoi]]"
    },
    "T4": {
     "en": [
      "procrastination is making you lose trust in yourself"
     ],
     "texte": "à peine 120 pages, ça se lit comme [[un vrai polar]]"
    }
   },
   "images": {
    "I1": {
     "remplacer": {
      "source": "sources/os_0d90650e.jpg",
      "boite": [
       0,
       0,
       2368,
       1760
      ]
     }
    }
   }
  },
  "3": {
   "textes": {
    "T1": {
     "en": [
      "let yourself be bored"
     ],
     "texte": "2. [[Bonjour tristesse]]"
    },
    "T2": {
     "en": [
      "every queue, walk and",
      "bathroom break gets filled",
      "with input now"
     ],
     "texte": "Sagan l'a écrit à 18 ans. un été sur la Côte d'Azur, une ado et son père"
    },
    "T3": {
     "en": [
      "that sounds harmless, but",
      "you're removing every",
      "chance your attention has",
      "to sit still"
     ],
     "texte": "Cécile a 17 ans, sa vie est parfaite, jusqu'à ce qu'Anne débarque. alors [[elle monte un plan]]"
    },
    "T4": {
     "en": [
      "spend 20–30 minutes a day with no podcast,",
      "music, scrolling or second screen"
     ],
     "texte": "tu la détestes, tu la comprends, et tu tournes les pages [[sans pouvoir t'arrêter]]"
    },
    "T5": {
     "en": [
      "listen to your thoughts"
     ],
     "texte": "[[une soirée]] et c'est fini"
    }
   },
   "images": {
    "I1": {
     "remplacer": {
      "source": "sources/os_0ba43121.jpg",
      "boite": [
       0,
       0,
       1504,
       2784
      ]
     }
    }
   }
  },
  "4": {
   "textes": {
    "T1": {
     "en": [
      "learn to tolerate boring repetition"
     ],
     "texte": "3. [[Fahrenheit 451]], Ray Bradbury"
    },
    "T2": {
     "en": [
      "most success is less",
      "exciting than it looks"
     ],
     "texte": "un monde où les pompiers [[brûlent les livres]]"
    },
    "T3": {
     "en": [
      "it’s doing the same",
      "useful things for",
      "months after the",
      "novelty disappears"
     ],
     "texte": "Montag en brûle tous les jours, jusqu'au soir où il en garde un et [[commence à lire]]"
    },
    "T4": {
     "en": [
      "consistency gets powerful when other people get bored",
      "and move on"
     ],
     "texte": "écrit en 1953, et franchement il parle [[de nous et de nos écrans]]"
    }
   },
   "images": {
    "I1": {
     "remplacer": {
      "source": "sources/os_38d562a6.jpg",
      "boite": [
       0,
       0,
       2368,
       1760
      ]
     }
    }
   }
  },
  "5": {
   "textes": {
    "T1": {
     "en": [
      "scrolling whenever you're bored"
     ],
     "texte": "4. [[Lettre d'une inconnue]], Zweig"
    },
    "T2": {
     "en": [
      "you can lose 2–3 hours a day without even noticing,",
      "then wonder why you have no time for the things you",
      "care about"
     ],
     "texte": "un écrivain reçoit la lettre d'une femme qu'il a oubliée. elle l'aime en secret depuis ses 13 ans, et [[elle lui raconte tout]]"
    },
    "T3": {
     "en": [
      "be deliberate with your",
      "time."
     ],
     "texte": "moins de 100 pages, [[une claque]]"
    },
    "T4": {
     "en": [
      "i personally use readup to",
      "block tiktok until i read for",
      "20 minutes, which keeps",
      "me from mindlessly scrolling"
     ],
     "texte": "et le soir, avant je scrollais H24, maintenant j'apprends un truc en 5 min sur [[l'appli Sophia]]"
    },
    "T5": {
     "en": [
      "your phone can wait until",
      "you have done one thing",
      "you meant to do."
     ],
     "texte": "hier soir, c'était Camus et le mythe de Sisyphe. j'en parle encore"
    }
   },
   "images": {
    "I1": "sophia_capture"
   }
  },
  "6": {
   "textes": {
    "T1": {
     "en": [
      "wake up before everyone else"
     ],
     "texte": "5. [[Gatsby le Magnifique]] (1925)"
    },
    "T2": {
     "en": [
      "no messages, no notifications, no one needs you yet"
     ],
     "texte": "des fêtes géantes, et un hôte [[que personne connaît]]"
    },
    "T3": {
     "en": [
      "the first hour of the day is",
      "when your focus is at its",
      "best, so use it for your",
      "own goals"
     ],
     "texte": "il a la villa, l'argent, les fêtes, mais il veut [[une seule chose]] de l'autre côté de la baie"
    },
    "T4": {
     "en": [
      "before anyone else can",
      "take your attention"
     ],
     "texte": "plus tu avances, [[plus tout se fissure]]"
    },
    "T5": {
     "en": [
      "even 30 minutes earlier makes a difference"
     ],
     "texte": "Fitzgerald, moins de 200 pages, [[un week-end]]"
    }
   },
